PROJECTILE
damagetype "WarRockStelar"
Obituary "\cvWar-Rock (%k) \c-went buck-wild on %o."
Damage (50)  // 50 ~ 100
radius 8
height 8
Speed 160  // 120  // 80
Scale 1.0  //2.5
States
{
